FraudShield
Copyright 2026 FraudShield contributors

This project was developed as a substantial extension and modernization of the CloudAcademy
fraud-detection project, distributed under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/cloudacademy/fraud-detection

The original project provided a logistic-regression training pipeline and Flask prediction
service. This version adds modern model evaluation, cost-sensitive threshold selection,
calibration, FastAPI serving, model metadata, monitoring, SQL analytics, and updated tests.

The original LICENSE is retained. Major Python implementation and documentation files in this
version were substantially rewritten or newly created.

